  {
    "id": "68645ec6-3bf7-5332-845d-760839fbe7a5",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:as-on-the-board-so-on-the-battlefield",
    "name": "As On the Board, So On the Battlefield",
    "level": 7,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["general", "skill"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 231,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8981"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You're a master of strategy games, able to translate strategies and mechanics from these games to the actual battles they were created to simulate. You can use your proficiency rank in Games Lore for anything that requires proficiency in Warfare Lore (such as prerequisites) and use your Games Lore modifier in place of your Warfare Lore modifier for checks. You can use Games Lore to Make an Impression on military professionals, such as mercenaries and commanders. Your reputation as a strategist opens up opportunities while you're in a military camp, near a battlefield, or somewhere else that has numerous non-hostile soldiers, allowing you to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b03a543f-4d12-5c6b-a4f9-6afe141aa651"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with Games Lore with a task level of at least your level –1."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you lead a troop and have had time to create a skirmish bond with them, you've also spent time going over the finer points of strategy and even played against many members of your troop. Once per day, you can roll Games Lore for initiative when leading this troop."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.UhIQ1lgwwtoeHFmf"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "skill",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "master in Games Lore"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "5a8cbf6b-f426-5c18-bea9-34cda4ae7bab",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:burning-demand",
    "name": "Burning Demand",
    "level": 12,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["auditory", "fire", "impulse", "kineticist", "linguistic", "overflow", "primal"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 228,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8977"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You create a faintly glowing sigil (shedding normal light in a 5-foot radius) on the target's body, after which you command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "f7fea8f9-c457-5b9f-9283-f567fa557184"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition), release what it's holding, drop "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "73c08daf-ef8e-5d9c-a2ac-dcdbfdafd759"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", or stand in place. The target then attempts a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": {
              "against": "class-dc"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save against your class DC."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The sigil immediately vanishes, and the creature is unaffected."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The sigil acts as a magnet for your fiery attacks, granting the creature a –1 penalty to its saves and AC against your fire impulses. The sigil lasts until the end of your next turn or until the creature spends at least 1 action obeying your command, whichever happens first."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " At the start of the creature's next turn, if it doesn't use their first action to obey the command, the sigil ignites as it vanishes, dealing "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "((@level/2)+2)d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage and "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "(floor((@level -12)/2)+2)d6",
                "damageType": "fire",
                "category": "persistent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage to the creature."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The creature must spend the first action of its next turn to obey your command; it can't Delay. The sigil vanishes at the end of its turn; it ignites if the creature didn't use all its remaining actions to continue to obey your command, dealing "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "((@level/2)+2)d6",
                "damageType": "fire"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage and "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "(floor((@level -12)/2)+2)d6",
                "damageType": "fire",
                "category": "persistent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage to the creature."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Level (+2)",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The damage increases by 1d6, and the persistent damage increases by 1d6."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.89pgMAnwGYbrJlWt"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "action": {
        "cost": "two"
      }
    }
  },
  {
