          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Access",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're an aristocrat or honored retainer from a Chelaxian noble house."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A noble house has invested in your training, imparting special techniques the family has honed over generations. You gain "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "50ac17a9-a644-58e8-8ee0-ce4c6cfbf17b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " as a skill feat, choosing from among Cheliax Lore, Devil Lore, Hell Lore, or a Lore associated with your house. In addition, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Deception checks, Diplomacy checks, Intimidation checks, and your Will DC against Chelaxian citizens and devils."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
