  {
    "id": "62460c65-fdda-5842-92ee-2e1d99bb42ba",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:improvise-strategy",
    "name": "Improvise Strategy",
    "level": 7,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["bravado", "concentrate", "general", "mental", "skill"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 231,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8982"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You're a wild card on the battlefield, inventing unpredictable tactics and surprising foes. You employ one of these strategies, adding either your choice of the auditory or visual trait. Attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:lore:warfare"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check against the Perception DC of a creature within 30 feet, after which the target becomes temporarily immune to further uses of Improvise Strategy for 1 hour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The target gains one of the following conditions of your choice until the end of your next turn: "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "69f88e3c-d871-5fb9-82c6-120348a7c0e8",
            "label": "Clumsy 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "943dfd55-ad09-5abf-9138-95a6149d3302"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "071324e5-bb4c-5ed2-9e2f-28185b65ded7"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9e1dad43-36fe-5629-923f-2df63c12d90f",
            "label": "Stupefied 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The target can end the effect by using either a single action with the concentrate trait to regain their bearings (if your strategy had the auditory trait) or an Interact action to rub their eyes (if your strategy had the visual trait). In addition, the target isn't temporarily immune to further uses of Improvise Strategy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As critical success, but the target is temporarily immune to further uses of Improvise Strategy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The target is unaffected."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The target sees through the gambit, leaving you off-guard until the beginning of your next turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Special",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Once per day, if you lead a troop that has a skirmish bond, you can Improvise Strategy to attempt a Warfare Lore check against a standard DC for your troop's level, rather than targeting a foe. If you succeed, your troop replaces its current skirmish bond with another of your choice until the end of your next turn."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.XbMfMJq2sCQHdo1w"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "skill",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "master in Warfare Lore"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "a23e5858-8fb8-52cc-8e4f-2a95ab2a7e92",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:liberating-dive",
    "name": "Liberating Dive",
    "level": 14,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["air", "composite", "impulse", "kineticist", "metal", "primal"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 229,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8979"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You sprout wings with steel feathers, resembling those of the celestial Talmandor. With a powerful flap, the wings propel you across the battlefield, slicing foes and restraints along your path. Until the end of your turn, you gain a fly Speed equal to your land Speed or 40 feet, whichever is greater. You then Fly up to your Speed, and this movement doesn't trigger reactions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Choose one foe and one ally you're adjacent to at any point during this movement. Using one wing's sharpened edge, you can use a 1-action Elemental Blast as a melee Strike using the metal element against the foe. With the other wing, you can help the ally break free of an effect grabbing, restraining, immobilizing, or paralyzing them; they either attempt a new save against one such effect that allows a save, or they attempt to Escape as a free action. The ally can use your impulse attack modifier in place of their unarmed attack modifier or skill check modifier."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.aUhx6xKOhPuK9fEZ"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "action": {
        "cost": "two"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "7c93c2e9-df84-5703-b5cd-338ac10e01ae",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:patronize-the-arts",
    "name": "Patronize the Arts",
    "level": 4,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["archetype"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 223,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8975"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " An ally within 30 feet of you critically succeeds at an attack roll or skill check."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A true aristocrat knows how to encourage their best hirelings, ensuring loyalty and future excellence. You praise the triggering ally, granting them one of the following benefits. The ally is then immune to this ability for 1 day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eagerness:",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Invigorated by praise, the ally can Feint, Interact with a nearby object, Leap, Reload, or Step as a reaction."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Persistence:",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " For 1 minute, the ally gains temporary Hit Points equal to half your level plus your Charisma modifier."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Validation:",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " If the ally has the panache class feature, they gain panache."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.5lGNRo5QarJHrkaA"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Chelaxian Scion Dedication"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "reaction",
        "trigger": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An ally within 30 feet of you critically succeeds at an attack roll or skill check."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "archetype": "035a2ac1-8d34-5cd3-8e4d-1bfa0404e186"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "05ea4ef1-052c-5a6e-81a4-466b35a83d8d",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:seasoned-command",
    "name": "Seasoned Command",
    "level": 7,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["auditory", "concentrate", "linguistic", "mental"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 232,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8983"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Allies intuitively follow your orders. Choose an ally within 30 feet and then attempt a Diplomacy or Intimidation check against a hard DC for that ally's level. This counts as a preparatory action to Aid that ally. Regardless of your result, the ally is then temporarily immune to your further uses of Seasoned Command for 1 minute."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You immediately gain an additional reaction that can be used only to Aid the chosen ally, and you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your skill check or attack roll to Aid."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As critical success, but you don't gain the circumstance bonus."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You don't gain an additional reaction."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Special",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Once per hour, you can Take the Lead of a troop as a free action (rather than 2 actions). Outside of combat, you can establish leadership of a troop and grant a skirmish bond in half the normal time (5 minutes and 4 hours, respectively)."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.c2hPWQ4zdc4CnrnZ"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "skill",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "master in either Diplomacy or Intimidation"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "8de93c6b-92f9-5962-bd59-0ccd34595113",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:stoic-as-hell",
    "name": "Stoic as Hell",
    "level": 6,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["archetype"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 223,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8976"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're targeted by an emotion effect or effect that would give you the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "3f5dc8b4-dcc0-5a99-8501-aff382e8d341"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Like the archdevil Dispater, you maintain an unshakable poise even under impossible stress. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the triggering saving throw or to your Will DC against the triggering effect. If you critically succeed at the saving throw (or if the source of the effect critically fails its skill check, such as to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "2a3671d0-7d0b-53db-8648-861d457f0175"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " you), you gain temporary Hit Points equal to half your level until the end of the effect's source's next turn. If the effect originated from a creature, you can Demoralize that creature once as a free action on your next turn; if the creature was temporarily immune to your attempts to Demoralize it, it loses that immunity."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.9Co9SUJmey3LrlLl"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Chelaxian Scion Dedication; trained in Intimidation; expert in Will"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "prerequisiteClauses": [
        {
          "text": "Chelaxian Scion Dedication",
          "predicate": ["feat:chelaxian-scion-dedication"]
        },
        {
          "text": "trained in Intimidation",
          "predicate": [
            {
              "gte": ["skill:intimidation:rank", 1]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "expert in Will"
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "reaction",
        "trigger": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You're targeted by an emotion effect or effect that would give you the Controlled condition."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "frequency": {
          "max": 1,
          "per": "minute"
        }
      },
      "archetype": "035a2ac1-8d34-5cd3-8e4d-1bfa0404e186"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "50de4e32-63a9-54e8-ac5a-f70e13f19ba2",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:tactical-acumen",
    "name": "Tactical Acumen",
    "level": 2,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["general", "skill"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "page": 232,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8984"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Even if you don't know much about its constituent creatures, you can always recognize a troop's capabilities through features like the formation they move in or even more subtle hints others might miss. You can always use Warfare Lore when you Recall Knowledge to identify a troop. This works like using an applicable Lore to identify a creature. If you're legendary in Warfare Lore, reduce any adjustment to the Recall Knowledge check's DC caused by the troop's rarity by 5."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you lead a troop, when you successfully use Warfare Lore to identify a troop, that troop takes a –1 circumstance penalty to saves against your troop's offensive abilities until the end of your next turn."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.d2opppdcH19LrAgy"
    },
